# GitHub counts a repository's languages with Linguist, which knows no
# Crow: the .co files, all of Magpie's code, are not counted. The article
# page and the test scripts are left out too, so GitHub names no language
# rather than call Magpie an HTML or Python project.
site/** -linguist-detectable
*.py -linguist-detectable
*.sh -linguist-detectable
